<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Rust crates in pure-runtime</title></head>
<body>
<h1>Rust crates in pure-runtime</h1>
<p>The runtime is built from the crates below. Each license's full text follows, with the crates that use it.</p>
<h2>Licenses used</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>{{#each used_by}}<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{#if crate.repository}} — {{crate.repository}}{{/if}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
